<title>USA: Sunamerica raises $577.5 mln in stock sale.</title>
<headline>Sunamerica raises $577.5 mln in stock sale.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>SunAmerica Inc Monday said it sold about 10.7 million shares of common stock, raising about $577.5 million in net proceeds.</p>
<p>The stock was part of a previously filed shelf registration.</p>
<p>Morgan Stanley &amp; Co Inc was the underwriter.  Proceeds will be used for for general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>SunAmerica is a diversified financial services company specializing in retirement savings and investment products and services.</p>
